# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rexford — repository ignore rules
#
# This one folder holds TWO very different things:
#   1. The public website, deployed to rexfordco.ca by Vercel
#   2. Private business documents — client proposals, contracts,
#      financials, questionnaires, insurance files
#
# Anything committed here is PUBLIC: it goes to a public GitHub repo AND
# gets served by Vercel. A blanket `git add -A` would publish client work.
#
# So this file is an ALLOWLIST, not a blocklist. Everything is ignored by
# default; only files the website actually needs are let back in. A new
# client folder is therefore private automatically — you never have to
# remember to exclude it.
#
# To publish a NEW website asset, add an explicit `!` rule below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1 ── Ignore everything at the repo root by default.
/*

# 2 ── Let the website back in.

# Config & core files
!/.gitignore
!/vercel.json
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/styles.css

# Public site pages
!/*.html

# ...except internal HTML that must never be published.
# (These come after !/*.html — later rules win.)
/summer-job-agreement.html
/_mockup.html

# Image assets used by the site
!/Brand Asset/
!/Affiliated Logos/
!/Caijsa.jpg
!/Kendra.jpg

# ...but not the internal brand book, and not raw font files
# (pages load Jost + Inter from Google Fonts, so no .ttf ships).
/Brand Asset/*.pdf
/Brand Asset/fonts/

# Marketing: publish the website photos, never the documents.
# The previous rules were `Marketing/*.pdf` and `Marketing/*.html`, which
# matched only the TOP level — they did NOT match Marketing/Proposal/*.html,
# so client proposals were publishable by accident. Un-ignoring just the
# image folders closes that hole permanently.
!/Marketing/
/Marketing/*
!/Marketing/website-photos/
# ...but never the raw drop-folder (huge originals, pre-optimization)
/Marketing/website-photos/New photos to use/
!/Marketing/drafting.png
!/Marketing/drafting 2.png
!/Marketing/kitchen 2.png

# Tooling: only scripts that build the site itself.
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/add_seo_metadata.ps1
!/tools/add_analytics.ps1

# 3 ── Secrets: never commit these, whatever any rule above says.
.env
.env.*
credentials.json
token.json
*.key
*.pem
